9FEIeEiBG0Y3GIiemQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_1_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_5MeYsyUQQUqHxsat8mw8hg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="yxt:NumberOfVotesForEachShare" scale="0" id="Narr_MTjpNlsHVkWMflvHAg-hWQ">twenty</ix:nonFraction> votes. Each Class&#160;B ordinary share is convertible into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_class_TxT_OHi6Vk2kSo97xMK_ig" contextRef="As_Of_7_1_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_5MeYsyUQQUqHxsat8mw8hg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="yxt:NumberOfOtherClassShareForEachShareConverted" scale="0" id="Narr_1vQErXQYyE2mAuMMxXJaOg">one</ix:nonFraction> Class&#160;A ordinary share at any time by the holder thereof. Class&#160;A ordinary shares are not convertible into Class&#160;B ordinary shares under any circumstances. Except for voting and conversion rights, holder of Class&#160;A ordinary shares and Class&#160;B ordinary shares have the same rights.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Upon the completion of the Company&#8217;s IPO on August&#160;15, 2024, (1)&#160;the Company offered and issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_6Fq0r_OGEky5Gbj__RiKpg" contextRef="Duration_8_15_2024_To_8_15_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_zvOxTFernESyrDSpVx6Psg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_qYiuNTN_ok6_QsvAVpAWaA">6,819,000</ix:nonFraction> Class&#160;A ordinary shares at the total gross proceeds of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_A-gQXq46QE2po1aRK2pCmQ" contextRef="Duration_8_15_2024_To_8_15_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_zvOxTFernESyrDSpVx6Psg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromIssuanceOfCommonStock" scale="3" id="Narr_rwgsTPD-2Eu-NNMFEHev7w">25,003</ix:nonFraction>,