poraryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesWarrantsExercised" scale="0" id="Narr_xT5BACR6Y0OC4kIwmGx58g">1,566,055</ix:nonFraction> Redeemable Convertible Series&#160;A-3 Preferred Shares (the &#8220;Series&#160;A Preferred Shares&#8221;, &#8220;Series&#160;A-3 Preferred Shares&#8221;), respectively. The total consideration was US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MPQ2MPNs406eYjQH4bU2sQ" contextRef="Duration_7_26_2018_To_7_26_2018_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_yxt_SeriesaWarrantMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriesa2AndSeriesa3RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_4sVnA8FEKU2x1qO5i9lfIw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yxt:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodValueWarrantsExercised" scale="3" id="Narr_3Q4jPF18K0yRpuXu2QaTTg">4,000</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">On June&#160;24, 2020, the Company and its subsidiaries entered into a series of share purchase agreements and acquired <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_6ae-4zkZ7ke8-jxNWF6KGw" contextRef="As_Of_6_24_2020_srt_OwnershipAxis_yxt_CeibsPublishingGroupLimitedMember_RZp_kh6zY06NYlfCiY2XxQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:MinorityInterestOwnershipPercentageByParent" scale="-2" id="Narr_lMiP2mpoT0W7QtpPvZ3_mA">60</ix:nonFraction>% of the shares of CEIBS Publishing Group. The Company and its subsidiaries obtained control of CEIBS Publishing Group. As part of the consideration, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_6Fq0r_OGEky5Gbj__RiKpg" contextRef="Duration_6_24_2020_To_6_24_2020_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriesa4RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_H_tnj8-9qEOR_5oUF-8I2A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yxt:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_lHygNXUwokukv2Ho3luM5Q">5,252,723</ix:nonFraction> Redeemable Convertible Series&#160;A-4 Prefe