l" name="yxt:SharesAcquiredConsiderationPaid" scale="3" id="Narr_jJ1l6MyllEOWG3CNiocIGA">16,177</ix:nonFraction> and these shares were re-designated into Series&#160;D-2 preferred shares (the &#8220;Series&#160;D Preferred Shares&#8221;, &#8220;Series&#160;D-2 Preferred Shares&#8221;) after transfer (&#8220;Series&#160;D-2 Transfer&#8221;). In this share transaction, the Company didn&#8217;t receive any consideration. The re-designation was approved through the Company&#8217;s shareholder resolution.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January&#160;25, 2021, the Company entered into a share purchase agreement with certain investors, pursuant to which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_6Fq0r_OGEky5Gbj__RiKpg" contextRef="Duration_1_25_2021_To_1_25_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese1RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_zbP49VtOGk6SiVJYIyyJXw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yxt:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_PbfC4pYHZUCI_VgkeMTeRw">16,883,753</ix:nonFraction> Redeemable Convertible Series&#160;E-1 Preferred Shares were issued for an aggregated consideration of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MPQ2MPNs406eYjQH4bU2sQ" contextRef="Duration_1_25_2021_To_1_25_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese1RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_zbP49VtOGk6SiVJYIyyJXw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues" scale="3" id="Narr_vSPcapo4PkmDzA3yqUgY5Q">90,000</ix:nonFraction>. The Company incurred issuance costs of US$ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MPQ2MPNs406eYjQH4bU2sQ" contextRef="Duration_1_25_2021_To_1_25_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese1RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_zbP49VtOGk6SiVJYIyyJXw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfStockIssuanceCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_uf6K6sAn1UKySfEyGN3Gew">1,376</ix:nonFraction> in connection with the offering of Series&#160;E-1 Preferred Shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January&#160;25, 2021, a Series&#160;E-1 Preferred Share investor acquired <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_6Fq0r_OGEky5Gbj__RiKpg" contextRef="As_Of_1_25_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese1RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_hmGty6DW3EGOMB2BCZu0gg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yxt:NumberOfOrdinaryShareAcquired" scale="0" id="Narr_agvGz6xI-UCydIn1lAEaoA">3,939,542</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares from one of the original shareholders with total consideration of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MPQ2MPNs406eYjQH4bU2sQ" contextRef="Duration_1_25_2021_To_1_25_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese1RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_zbP49VtOGk6SiVJYIyyJXw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yxt:SharesAcquiredConsiderationPaid" scale="3" id="Narr_uLTDIAp2AkutFMF23Rc7hQ">11,250</ix:nonFraction> and these shares were re-designated into Series&#160;D-3 Preferred Shares after transfer (&#8220;Series&#160;D-3 Transfer&#8221;). In the share transaction, the Company did not receive any consideration. Similar to the Series&#160;D-2 Transfer, in Series&#160;D-3 Transfer, ordinary shareholder gave up their benefit to maintain the new investor. The re-designation was approved through the Company&#8217;s shareholder resolution.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March&#160;22, 2021, the Company entered into a share purchase agreement with certain investors, pursuant to which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_6Fq0r_OGEky5Gbj__RiKpg" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2021_To_3_22_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese2RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_XWxxR-Fpf0mO7faP4iVliw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="yxt:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_ACQV79rPpEqAoO8Wu3U-dg">9,533,565</ix:nonFraction> Series&#160;E-2 Redeemable Convertible Preferred Shares were issued for an aggregated consideration of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MPQ2MPNs406eYjQH4bU2sQ" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2021_To_3_22_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese2RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_XWxxR-Fpf0mO7faP4iVliw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:TemporaryEquityStockIssuedDuringPeriodValueNewIssues" scale="3" id="Narr_t7oEWwd15E2bnN00OosK5g">64,328</ix:nonFraction>. The Company incurred issuance costs of US$ <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_MPQ2MPNs406eYjQH4bU2sQ" contextRef="Duration_3_22_2021_To_3_22_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_yxt_Seriese2RedeemableConvertiblePreferredStockMember_XWxxR-Fpf0mO7faP4iVliw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:PaymentsOfStockIssuanceCosts" scale="3" id="Narr_ngDI0FpIskG70QCnnVVBpQ">910</ix:nonFraction> in connection with the offering of Series&#160;E-2 Preferred Shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July&#160;1, 2024, the Company approved the conversion of all of the Company&#8217;s outstanding convertible redeemable preferred shares into ordinary shares on a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_6ae-4zkZ7ke8-jxNWF6KGw" contextRef="As_Of_7_1_2024_2PnvDbGUWE6yhdi9wocE0w" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:PreferredStockConvertibleConversionRatio" scale="0" id="Narr_3UYoSRg2yEqPy-C9f0Gz0g">one</ix:nonFraction>-for-one basis was adjusted from weight-average anti-dilution mechanism to full-ratchet anti-dilution mechanism if the issuance price of the securities issued in the IPO, which is determined based on the per share offering price (the &#8220;initial public offering price&#8221;), was lower than the respective issuance prices of the Company&#8217;s Preferred Shares when they were issued.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Series&#160;A, B, C, D and E Preferred Shares are collectively referred to as the Preferred Shares. The holders of Preferred Shares are collectively referred to as the Preferred Shareholders.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">All Preferred Shares were automatically converted into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_6Fq0r_OGEky5Gbj__RiKpg" contextRef="As_Of_8_15_2024_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_zvqmaBacMUyNIFq7koXjbQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConvertiblePreferredStockSharesIssuedUponConversion" scale="0" id="Narr_rLHC0ldNPEKmrqpZUAm8vQ">125,154,172</ix:nonFraction> Series&#160;A ordinary share upon the completion of IPO on August&#160;15, 2024. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The key terms of the Preferred Shares issued by the Company are as follows:</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Redemption Rights</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">At any time commencing on a date when certain events specified in the shareholders&#8217; agreement (the &#8220;Redemption Start Date&#8221;) occurred, any holders of the then outstanding Series&#160;A, B, C, D Preferred Shares may request a redemption of specified number of Preferred Shares of such series as determined by the shareholders. On receipt of a redemption request from the holders, the Company shall redeem all of the Preferred Shares requested.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Redemption Start Date of Preferred Shares have been amended for a number of times historically. If any holder of any series of Preferred Shares exercises its redemption right, any holder of other series of Preferred Shares shall have the right to exercise the redemption of its series at the same time.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-56</p></div></div>
